=== RESIDUAL ATTRIBUTION ===
The path.Clean `/x/../\host` vector is the CVE-2026-25779 residual: Gitea 1.25.4 still
approved it; the `!strings.Contains(u.Path,"\\")` check (== the fix) landed in 1.25.5/1.26.0
